ain_29_07_s_12","text":"that brake was beyond a doubt created by some kind of separate intelligent being.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_29_07_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_29_07_s_13","text":"It is not a particularly sophisticated mechanism, but that is beside the point.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_29_07_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_29_07_s_14","text":"What's important is its placement inside the crystal cluster.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_29_07_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_29_07_s_15","text":"This tells me that this entire process I've just described was intentionally designed by someone, or something, and that the crystal being transported is part of that individual's design.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_29_07_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_29_07_s_16","text":"Unfortunately, at this point in time, there is no way for us to find out who that someone is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_29_07_s_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_29_07_s_17","text":"I'm willing to bet it's that Pilgrim we ran into.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"black","bgArt":"black","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["unknown_grave"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_29_07_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","k